		{
			description: [
				"Bring food, blocks, a ranged weapon, a marked portal and a spare return route. Falling into the void is not a plan."
				"Build the portal area as a safe sky outpost with walls, lighting, storage, food, spare blocks, and a protected landing. Falling into the void is an environmental failure that armour alone cannot solve."
				"The Skyward Accord says every bridge needs a return rail, every island route needs spare blocks, and every rare material needs one researched sample before the rest becomes building stock."
				"The Aether restarts progression with Skyroot, Holystone, Ambrosium, Zanite, Gravitite, and its own utility stations. Treat Overworld equipment as expedition support while learning what the dimension expects locally."
