		{
			description: [
				"The Aether changes movement, equipment and terrain expectations. Carry blocks, food and a recovery plan, and assume every cliff edge is more dangerous than it appears."
				"Learn Aether equipment slots and materials rather than judging everything by Overworld armour habits. JEI and tooltips explain bonuses that ordinary comparisons miss."
				"Build bridges with rails or walls where the group will travel repeatedly. Courage is not a substitute for infrastructure."
				"The Aether restarts progression with Skyroot, Holystone, Ambrosium, Zanite, Gravitite, and its own utility stations. Treat Overworld equipment as expedition support while learning what the dimension expects locally."
			]
