		{
			dependencies: ["680B1B64274D9FCC"]
			description: [
				"Aether dungeons have distinct keys, bosses and reward structures. Read the room before using rare items, and keep space available for unique loot."
				"Do not split the party across sealed encounters without agreeing first. Mark cleared sites and share equipment that specifically helps the next dungeon tier."
				"The sky temples were built above ordinary weather, but not above pride. Most failed expeditions arrive overconfident and under-supplied."
				"Bronze, Silver, and Gold dungeons have different structures, bosses, and access rules. Dungeons are generally personal progression spaces, so agree on ownership and regroup outside rather than forcing everyone through one doorway."
