		{
			description: [
				"Skyroot tools can improve yields from appropriate Aether materials, while Holystone tools can occasionally uncover Ambrosium as they work. Zanite equipment becomes stronger as its durability falls."
				"Gravitite is found deep in islands and becomes Enchanted Gravitite through the Altar. Its tools, armour and block behaviour are the late material lesson of the dimension."
				"Check the Book of Lore and JEI before replacing every Overworld tool. The Aether is designed to make its own material ladder useful, not merely decorative."
				"The Aether restarts progression with Skyroot, Holystone, Ambrosium, Zanite, Gravitite, and its own utility stations. Treat Overworld equipment as expedition support while learning what the dimension expects locally."
