		{
			dependencies: ["6FAC4DAFFCFE73DB"]
			description: [
				"Moas are Aether birds whose eggs can be hatched in an Incubator. Different colours provide different riding characteristics, so the first egg is not automatically the final mount."
				"Use the Book of Lore and installed recipes for incubation and taming materials. Prepare a sealed, spacious nursery before hatching anything beside the void."
				"Practise jumps above a safe island and give the mount a named home. Flight is transportation only when landing and recovery are planned."
				"The Book of Lore identifies Aether objects; JEI explains recipes; dungeon blocks and messages explain progression locks. Use all three before assuming a door, chest, or machine is bugged."
