			dependencies: ["36207C89BD176A3E"]
			description: [
				"Bronze Dungeons are buried labyrinths with the Slider; Silver Dungeons are cloud temples with Valkyries and their Queen; Gold Dungeons house the Sun Spirit."
				"Each boss has an interaction or damage rule. Bring the appropriate tool, gather the Queen's required proof and watch what the Sun Spirit's arena provides instead of assuming immunity is a bug."
				"Boss keys open their protected treasure. Let every participant finish looting before leaving, and never lose the only key in an unlabelled backpack."
				"The Book of Lore identifies Aether objects; JEI explains recipes; dungeon blocks and messages explain progression locks. Use all three before assuming a door, chest, or machine is bugged."
