			description: [
				"The Aether adds gloves, rings, pendants, capes and shields with movement, mining or environmental effects. Some use dedicated Aether or Curios-style slots rather than the ordinary armour grid."
				"Equip one new item at a time and test it at the outpost. Movement effects are especially dangerous when the nearest mistake is a fall into the void."
				"Keep situational accessories in labelled expedition storage so the next dungeon team can select a purpose-built loadout instead of wearing every relic at once."
